{
    "title": "My Home Design: Makeover Games",
    "description": "Welcome to My Home Design: Makeover Games. Solve word search game puzzles to help wonder, design, decorate, renovate, build, fix, match, flip, remodel & create the perfect dream project home makeover with room decor life. Play the newest home design meets word search puzzle game! Help clients design, master, makeover & decorate dream homes and transform their dreams into reality with home makeovers! Connect letters to find every word on the board. Challenge your brain in free home design words search game.\r\n\r\nThe goal is to wonder, design, decorate, create, makeover, match, flip, fix, remodel, renovate your client\u2019s house project, mansion or 3d home & play word search puzzles. Become the best home designer as families are counting on you to renovate their home down-and-out fixer upper! \r\n\r\nExpand your vocabulary & demonstrate your interior designer skills as you seek and search words, solve word puzzles in this free 3d home design word seek game.\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURES :\r\n* Renovate: Remodel 3d homes, mansion, houses, manor with traditional interior styles or go Modern? You decide, you design! Rebuild outdated interior designs into outstanding big makeovers fixer upper with bold happy accents, pops of color, stylish fixtures & finishes.\r\n\r\n* House Design: Master various styles at your own disposal! Wonder, makeover, master, build, create, renovate, decorate, match, fix, flip client\u2019s 3d dream project houses, mansion, manor and homes by yourself & make them happy! \r\n\r\n* Furniture Styles: Own & master all furniture styles & become a truly professional decorator, each client with their own design challenge! Renovate a variety of fixer upper that needs your interior design eye: big kitchens, bathrooms, decks, living rooms, manor, offices & more!\r\n\r\n* Multiple houses / mansion / homes: Not happy with decorating, building, designing, creating only one house fixer upper & life story? We have plenty of 3d houses for you to wonder, build, flip, design, craft, match, renovate, remodel, create or decorate! Renovate different dream room project styles including family-friendly living rooms, rustic kitchens, stylish bathrooms, chic bedrooms, study rooms, manor, own office spaces & chilled out decks!\r\n\r\n* Express yourself: With an incredible variety of high-end designer furniture, lighting, flooring and other decor choices. Challenge your sense of design - adjust wall colors, flooring and furniture placements to harmonize the atmosphere. Customize every piece of your own furniture.\r\n\r\n* Different Stories: Work with multiple client personalities. Help various HGTV like clients brothers, celebrities, families, newlyweds to transform big dreams into reality. Build the most incredible property or fixer upper for brothers, celebrities & families with kids. Help them wonder, master, create, decorate, renovate, build, match, flip, fix, remodel and makeover their dream life project homes, broken houses, manor & old mansion into dream happy makeovers.\r\n\r\n* Exciting word find levels: Test & improve your spelling, vocabulary and word skills for free. Enjoy the best selection of word search / word seek / word find. Connect and link letters to form the longest words & become a word finder. Play finding words games with friends and family, become a word finder. If you like to find words, scramble words, or guessing words, if like crossword games, word puzzle games or brain-teasers then this is for you. Intelligently designed free crossword puzzles allows you to train your brain by connecting, searching the words. Experience incredible brain challenging fun in the most addictive word seek game.\r\n\r\n* Rewards: Unlock rewards as you impress your big clients by decorating the home, house of their dreams with big happy makeovers. Solve the puzzles and find all life answers from the crosswords.\r\n\r\nYou don\u2019t have to be a house flipper in real life or know house building, interior designing, decorating, creating, renovating or flipping. My Home Design: Makeover Games is a free to play.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to My Home Design: Makeover Games. Solve word search game puzzles to help wonder, design, decorate, renovate, build, fix, match, flip, remodel &amp; create the perfect dream project home makeover with room decor life. Play the newest home design meets word search puzzle game! Help clients design, master, makeover &amp; decorate dream homes and transform their dreams into reality with home makeovers! Connect letters to find every word on the board. Challenge your brain in free home design words search game.<br><br>The goal is to wonder, design, decorate, create, makeover, match, flip, fix, remodel, renovate your client\u2019s house project, mansion or 3d home &amp; play word search puzzles. Become the best home designer as families are counting on you to renovate their home down-and-out fixer upper! <br><br>Expand your vocabulary &amp; demonstrate your interior designer skills as you seek and search words, solve word puzzles in this free 3d home design word seek game.<br><br>GAME FEATURES :<br>* Renovate: Remodel 3d homes, mansion, houses, manor with traditional interior styles or go Modern? You decide, you design! Rebuild outdated interior designs into outstanding big makeovers fixer upper with bold happy accents, pops of color, stylish fixtures &amp; finishes.<br><br>* House Design: Master various styles at your own disposal! Wonder, makeover, master, build, create, renovate, decorate, match, fix, flip client\u2019s 3d dream project houses, mansion, manor and homes by yourself &amp; make them happy! <br><br>* Furniture Styles: Own &amp; master all furniture styles &amp; become a truly professional decorator, each client with their own design challenge! Renovate a variety of fixer upper that needs your interior design eye: big kitchens, bathrooms, decks, living rooms, manor, offices &amp; more!<br><br>* Multiple houses / mansion / homes: Not happy with decorating, building, designing, creating only one house fixer upper &amp; life sto